{
  "key": 9255,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Route15_WestEntrance_1F_Text_OaksAideCameByHere",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you the kid who’s working on\n",
        "a Pokédex?\r",
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide came by here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_GiveItemIfCaughtEnough",
      "en_US": [
        "Hi! Remember me?\n",
        "I’m one of Prof. Oak’s Aides.\r",
        "If your Pokédex has complete data\n",
        "on {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} species, I’m supposed to\f",
        "give you a reward.\r",
        "Prof. Oak entrusted me with the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} for you.\r",
        "So, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}, let me ask you.\r",
        "Have you gathered data on at least\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds of Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_GreatHereYouGo",
      "en_US": [
        "Great! You have caught or owned\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "Congratulations!\n",
        "Here you go!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_ReceivedItemFromAide",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\n",
        "from the Aide."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_ExplainExpShare",
      "en_US": [
        "EXP. Share is an item to be held\n",
        "by a Pokémon.\r",
        "The Pokémon will receive a share\n",
        "of the EXP. Points without having\f",
        "to battle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_LargeShiningBird",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see what the binoculars have\n",
        "to show…\r",
        "A large, shining bird is flying\n",
        "toward the sea."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Route15_WestEntrance_2F_Text_SmallIslandOnHorizon",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see what the binoculars have\n",
        "to show…\r",
        "It looks like a small island on\n",
        "the horizon!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Aide_Text_GetEnoughMonsComeBackForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "…Oh. I see.\r",
        "When you get {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds of Pokémon,\n",
        "come back for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Aide_Text_HaventCaughtEnoughMonsForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Let’s see…\n",
        "Uh-oh! You have caught only\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} kinds of Pokémon!\r",
        "You need {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} kinds\n",
        "if you want the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_Aide_Text_DontHaveAnyRoomForItem",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! I see you don’t have any\n",
        "room for the {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0353_R15R0101_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
